:''This article is about the enemy. For the Cat Unit, see [[Kagamine Rin & Len (Uber Rare Cat)]].''
'''Kagamine Rin & Len''' are a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appear in the [[Hatsune Miku Collaboration Event]]. They were added in [[Version 9.4 Update|Version 9.4]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Kagamine Rin & Len
|image = E 502.png
|appearance = [[Hatsune Miku Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 4,000¢ - 15,800¢
}}

==Enemy==
They have [[Long Distance]] attacks with a guaranteed chance to [[Knockback|knockback]] and [[Slow|slow]] Cat Units. However, not much pushing needs to be done to reach to their blind spot, so sending in some [[:Category:Rusher-class Cats|rushers]] will do the job.

